PROSE SUMMARY (context, not a substitute for the structured log above)
---------------------------------------------------------------------
Short 17-turn shutout. BladeDragon5000's Lamball/Foxparks chipped Pants early (10->9->7) before Pants's own Chillet and Foxparks-kill briefly stabilized the board (turns 3-5). BladeDragon5000's Chillet and Lamball resumed the grind (7->5->3->2, turns 6/8), with two bare-form Dinossom interrupts on turn 8 nullifying Chillet and Jormuntide swings in the same turn. Pants's Rushoar/Petallia/Digtoise repeatedly attacked BladeDragon5000's Jormuntide/Jormuntide Ignis but every attack was neutralized - a bare-form Foxparks interrupt (turn 12), paid-Soul Cryolinx and Reindrix interrupts (turns 10, 14), a blocking Jormuntide Ignis trade that destroyed Petallia (turn 15), and a final paid-Soul Foxparks interrupt (turn 16) - meaning BladeDragon5000 took zero damage the entire game. BladeDragon5000's Jormuntide delivered the final 3 damage turn 17 (2 to 0).


